	<id>opencase</id>
	<name>OpenCase</name>
	<summary>Case and content management system to Danish municipalities</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
OpenCase provides a comprehensive case and document management system
(ESDH) designed for Danish municipalities, built as a native Nextcloud app.

Features:
- Case management with KLE classification codes
- Document management with versioning
- Fine-grained access control based on organisation, classification, and sensitivity
- Full-text search via Elasticsearch with Danish language support
- Native integration with Nextcloud Office (Collabora/ONLYOFFICE)
- Virtual filesystem integration — access case files from Mail, Talk, and other apps
- Per-user document access overrides
- Comprehensive REST API
    ]]></description>
